OL,3,GNEWSAWater pipes fixed, but some homes
OL,4,Astill cut off
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs to two burst pipes that left
OL,7,Fthousands of people without water have
OL,8,Fbeen completed, Anglian Water says.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, 36,000 customers in
OL,11,FScunthorpe and the surrounding area
OL,12,Fwere left with no water or low pressure
OL,13,Fafter the flow of water into a local
OL,14,Fstorage reservoir stopped.
OL,16,FAnglian Water said 1,800 customers in
OL,17,FKirton in Lindsey were still without
OL,18,Fwater on Friday morning.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
