OL,3,GNEWSAWater pipes fixed, but some homes
OL,4,Astill cut off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "We are working as
OL,7,Fquickly as possible to get the pumps
OL,8,Frestarted and get those customers back
OL,9,Fon. Since last night we have been
OL,10,Fdelivering bottled water to those
OL,11,Fcustomers still off water."
